[[Cap of Discomfort]] is a neutral [[Helmet]] normally obtained by combining a [[Cap of Resilience]] with a [[Corrupted Crystal]]. It gives the same damage reduction at battle start as the [[Cap of Resilience]], but for longer, has a chance to nullify opponent buffs, and reduces the opponent's healing by a substantial amount.

With multiple [[Cap of Discomfort]]s and/or [[Amethyst]]s, it can become feasible to reduce the opponent's healing to zero, which would be absolutely crushing to some otherwise extremely powerful healing builds. Of course, even a lesser degree of healing nullification would be of significant help in such a matchup.
